# ========================================
# BSM PLATFORM GITIGNORE CONFIGURATION
# Comprehensive ignore patterns for Next.js enterprise application
# Excludes sensitive data, build artifacts, and development files
# Configured for Supabase, TypeScript, and modern tooling
# Includes patterns for various IDEs and operating systems
# Optimized for team collaboration and CI/CD pipelines
# Prevents accidental commits of secrets and credentials
# Includes patterns for testing and deployment artifacts
# Covers all major package managers and tools
# Updated for modern development workflows
# ========================================

